  "untrusted": {
    "_comment": "Named entries go in `entities` (domain or name, with a reason and source). The default list ships no named third parties: scam domains churn daily, so load a current feed with `earnest merchant import-blocklist` (one domain per line, e.g. from a PhishTank/URLhaus export or your bank's fraud alerts) or add entries with `earnest merchant distrust`. The rules below catch the common patterns without a feed.",
